# Stormsplitter: "Whenever you cast an instant or sorcery spell, create a token that's a copy of this creature. Exile that token at the beginning of the next end step."
# (CR 603.2, 707.2, 603.7c). Bot1 casts it with four Moxen (it has haste), then Bolts Bot2: a 1/4 token copy with haste enters, the original is untouched.
# At the end step the token is exiled; Bot2's life 17 shows the Bolt resolved.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Stormsplitter
Lightning Bolt
Mountain
Island x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
